        "Content": "\nDNG Tipperary Town are pleased to present for sale 4 Sean Allen Terrace, Tipperary Town \nRecently modernized residence but requiring minor finishing works in a very convenient location just a short stroll from the town centre, primary & secondary schools.\n\nIdeal for the first time buyer, investor of retiree.\n\nOpen-plan dining / living area with bright modern kitchen. Shower room with electric shower. Two ample bedrooms.\n\nLarge rear garden containing series of storage sheds. Rear entrance & parking.\n\nElectric storage heating \n\nViewing highly recommeded but strictly through selling agent Paul Cranley"
